{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40522","headline":"世迷 · 苏拯","name":"世迷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌兔日夜行，与人运枯荣。\n爲善不常缺，爲恶不常盈。\n天道无阿党，人心自覆倾。\n所以多迁变，宁合天地情。\n我愿造化手，莫放狐兔走。\n恣海产珍奇，纵地生花柳。\n美者一齐美，丑者一齐丑。\n民心归大朴，战争亦何有。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}